{% for relation in relations %}
- {{ relation.source_title }} -> {{ relation.target_title }} | {{ relation.relation_type }} | confidence: {{ relation.confidence }}
  Evidence: {{ relation.evidence }}
{% endfor %}

Return exactly four Korean sections:

## 계보 해석
Explain the main connected theme and direction in two to four sentences. Separate the approved graph facts from cautious interpretation.

## 승인 관계 설명
- Explain every supplied approved relation in natural Korean: what the source claim contributes to the target claim, why the relation type fits, and the relevant condition or limit.
- Use card titles and relation types, but do not merely repeat the graph labels.

## 추가 검토 후보 관계
- Suggest at most three potential directed relations among the supplied cards only when their claims and conditions make them defensible.
- For each, write: source title → target title | possible relation type | why it merits review | condition or reservation.
- If no defensible candidate exists, write "후보 관계 없음" and explain why. Never describe a candidate as approved.

## 공백과 다음 검토
- State what is not yet connected, contrasted, or supported strongly enough.
